*Dear Data Protection Officers, Security Personnel, and Compliance
Officers,*

*Warm greetings!*
*Interglic Consultancy OPC*, in partnership with the *Organization of Dat=
a
Privacy Professionals, Inc. (ODPP)*, is pleased to invite you to
participate in our upcoming *Data Privacy Webinars. *These webinars are
designed to strengthen awareness and practical implementation of data
